      "description": "<p>Yinon Levi faces trial for reckless manslaughter related to the 2025 killing of Awdah Hathaleen </p><p>Israeli prosecutors have charged a Jewish settler over the killing of a Palestinian community leader in the occupied West Bank last year – the ⁠first such indictment in nearly three years.</p><p>In papers filed by the state attorney’s office, Yinon Levi is charged with reckless manslaughter in the death of Awdah Hathaleen, a prominent ⁠activist who was involved in the 2025 Oscar-winning documentary No Other Land.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/06/israel-charges-west-bank-settler-killing-palestinian-activist-awdah-hathaleen\">Continue reading...</a>",
